  - m_Id: 101423537724420096
    m_Localized:
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101431617510010880
    m_Localized: Ice Skates
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101431617610674176
    m_Localized:
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101437821565104128
    m_Localized: Launcher Tower Toss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101437821674156032
    m_Localized:
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102777508791984128
    m_Localized: Execution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102777508833927168
    m_Localized: Stab in front of you. This hit has +10% Execution Threshold, added
      to your equipment. Enemies left below the threshold are instantly killed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103099397276049408
    m_Localized: Extraction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103099397317992448
    m_Localized: Hook the nearest enemy in front of you and wrench the axe from the
      wound. This hit gains +100% Bleed Extraction Chance. Extraction consumes the
      strongest old bleed to deal Bleed Extraction of its remaining damage. This
      extra damage cannot crit or inflict ailments. The weapon hit can apply a new
      bleed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103123438414209024
    m_Localized: Falling Anvil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103123438460346368
    m_Localized: A heavy hammer strike. In the air, hold the hammer downward and
      strike upon landing. Fall height increases impact damage up to a cap. Jump
      Force helps gain height; Area of Effect widens the impact. You remain vulnerable
      during descent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103128754073772032
    m_Localized: Lucky Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103128754115715072
    m_Localized: Fire an arrow that ricochets from surfaces and then aims toward
      the nearest reachable enemy. The ricochet empowers the hit. Projectile Chain
      adds wall bounces instead of enemy chains; Projectile Speed shortens travel
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103135056044892160
    m_Localized: Lightning Rod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103135056091029504
    m_Localized: Place two fixed electrodes. A discharge travels repeatedly between
      them, hitting each enemy on the line once per pass. Keep targets between the
      electrodes. Area of Effect increases their separation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103147147069890560
    m_Localized: Frost Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103147147120222208
    m_Localized: Creates an ice barrier ahead that intercepts enemy attacks and projectiles
      and retaliates with cold shards based on main-hand weapon damage. Consumes
      one available Mystic Shield charge to increase damage and duration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103151794727821312
    m_Localized: Crimson Hook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103151794769764352
    m_Localized: A long-reaching grapple strikes enemies ahead and pulls movable
      targets toward you. Heavy and immobile targets take damage without displacement.
      Area of Effect widens the grapple, helping gather groups.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103203139270877184
    m_Localized: Prismatic Cycle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103203139358957568
    m_Localized: Shots cycle through fire, cold, and lightning, converting all weapon
      damage to the current element. Every fourth use fires a prismatic volley, split
      equally between the three elements, with 100% more spell damage. Progress counts
      uses, not projectiles or hits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103407469831790592
    m_Localized: Tectonic Press
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103407469873733632
    m_Localized: Strike for 250% weapon damage with empowered knockback. A pushed
      target colliding with a wall or another enemy generates a shockwave dealing
      200% weapon damage, once per pushed target. Pushback increases travel; Area
      of Effect expands collision and shockwave radii. Shockwave Damage scales only
      the wave and starts at 100%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103420026508419072
    m_Localized: Circular Saw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103420026613276672
    m_Localized: One disk strikes for 250% weapon damage. On contact it stops in
      place for 2.5 seconds, sawing up to 10 times at 0.25-second intervals for 50%
      of the skill's damage. Enemies can leave the saw. It then returns to the character,
      dealing 50% of normal damage. Effect Duration extends the pause, not the hit
      cap. Projectile Speed speeds up travel; Projectile Count adds no disks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103435650517311488
    m_Localized: Retreating Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103435650601197568
    m_Localized: Thrust in a long narrow line for 250% weapon damage, reaching up
      to 3.2 metres, then immediately hop backward. Gain 1 percentage point of critical
      hit chance for this skill per 100 Evasion. Uses the weapon's critical multiplier.
      The retreat grants no invulnerability and respects obstacles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103440087742816256
    m_Localized: Needle Prick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103440087843479552
    m_Localized: 'One very short stab at the nearest enemy in front: 75% weapon damage
      at twice attack speed. Reach: 0.9 metres. This skill gains +100 percentage
      points of critical multiplier, plus another +2 points per 1% critical hit chance.
      Stay close to the target.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103491619955503104
    m_Localized: Mana Spear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103491620001640448
    m_Localized: Fire one narrow magic spear for 100% weapon damage converted to
      lightning. Every complete 75 Max Mana adds 5 flat lightning damage to this
      skill. Projectile Pierce allows additional targets along the line. Projectile
      Count, Fork and Chain do not change the single straight shot. Current mana
      does not affect the bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103502318383493120
    m_Localized: Torn Edge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103502318458990592
    m_Localized: A slow sweeping strike with a two-handed sword or axe deals 250%
      weapon damage. Each percentage point of Crit Multiplier adds one point to this
      skill's Bleed Damage Multiplier, even on non-critical hits. Uses your normal
      chance to inflict bleed; bleeding is not guaranteed. Attacks at 70% of normal
      speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103515101401542656
    m_Localized: Conning Tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103515101506400256
    m_Localized: 'Three full sweeps around the player with a two-handed axe hit enemies
      on both sides: the first two deal 100% weapon damage each, followed by a powerful
      350% final swing. Dodging away interrupts the combo and forfeits the remaining
      strikes. Mana and cooldown are spent once when the combo starts. Attack Speed
      speeds up the sequence; Area of Effect expands the sweeps.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103576020395585536
    m_Localized: Horizon Cross-section
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103576020483665920
    m_Localized: After a pronounced wind-up, releases one broad sword wave dealing
      300% weapon damage well beyond melee range. Each point of Movement Speed adds
      5 physical damage before the skill multiplier. Area of Effect increases the
      wave's size. Additional projectiles, Fork and Chain do not create extra waves.
      The wave passes through enemies and stops at walls. Dodging before release
      cancels the wave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103586299841966080
    m_Localized: Thunder Hammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103586299921657856
    m_Localized: A heavy strike deals 100% weapon damage and releases an electrical
      discharge in the same area. Every complete 150 Armor adds 5 lightning damage
      for this skill only. Physical damage continues to build stun; lightning damage
      helps inflict shock under the normal rules. Attack Speed accelerates the strike;
      Area of Effect expands its area. No cooldown or mana cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103596792891666432
    m_Localized: The Weight of a Giant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103596793055244288
    m_Localized: 'Take a planted stance and deliver one devastating strike after
      a very slow wind-up, dealing 500% weapon damage. Every complete 75 Max Health
      adds 5 flat physical damage to this skill before its damage multiplier. Area
      of Effect expands the impact radius. Attack Speed accelerates the sequence.
      The stance restricts movement without granting invulnerability; dodging interrupts
      the wind-up. Cooldown: 15 seconds. Mana cost: 35.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103603522648240128
    m_Localized: Near Fan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103603522757292032
    m_Localized: "Fire 5 arrows simultaneously across a 70\xB0 fan, each dealing
      100% weapon damage. Several arrows can hit one enemy at close range; the wider
      spread covers multiple targets at distance. Projectile Count adds arrows inside
      the same angle, increasing volley density. Projectile Speed accelerates travel;
      Attack Speed accelerates the shot. Cooldown: 10 seconds. Mana cost: 20."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103607846770143232
    m_Localized: Aerial Volley
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103607846849835008
    m_Localized: 'Leap backward without turning away and fire 3 consecutive forward
      volleys of 3 arrows. Each arrow deals 200% weapon damage. Jump Force increases
      leap height and distance. Projectile Count adds arrows to every volley. The
      leap grants no invulnerability. Dodging interrupts remaining volleys. Cooldown:
      10 seconds. Mana cost: 10.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103764307898888192
    m_Localized: Pendulum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103764307991162880
    m_Localized: One disc follows a fixed straight line, reversing at 0.6 and 1.2
      seconds and disappearing at 1.8 seconds. The first pass deals 100% weapon damage;
      both later passes use 50% of normal damage plus Returning Projectile Damage.
      Each target can be hit once per pass. Projectile Speed lengthens each pass
      without changing turn intervals. The disc does not track the character and
      stops at walls; Projectile Count, Fork and Chain add no discs. No cooldown
      or mana cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103768030138167296
    m_Localized: A Fan of Sickles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103768030259802112
    m_Localized: "Throw 3 discs simultaneously across a 50\xB0 fan, each dealing
      100% weapon damage outward. After 0.4 seconds they home toward the character's
      current position, so movement changes their return paths. Each disc can hit
      a target once outward and once returning. Return hits use 50% of normal damage
      plus Returning Projectile Damage. Projectile Count adds discs inside the same
      fan. Discs pass through enemies and walls and disappear when caught. No cooldown
      or mana cost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103772787108048896
    m_Localized: Flaming Spear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103772787187740672
    m_Localized: 'Fire one long spear for 250% weapon damage converted to fire. Each
      Ignite already on the target adds 20% direct hit damage: three effects grant
      +60%. Ignites remain active. Max Ignite Stacks enables stronger hits; Projectile
      Pierce adds targets along the line. The bonus is checked separately on each
      target at impact. Cooldown: 10 seconds. Mana: 25.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103775990461591552
    m_Localized: Frost-induced Jolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103775990570643456
    m_Localized: 'A short cold wave hits nearby enemies on both sides for 250% weapon
      damage converted to cold, pushing them away from the character. Radius: 1.75.
      Base knockback rating: 750. Every complete 1% Cold Resistance adds 10 knockback
      rating to this skill only. Area of Effect expands the wave; normal freeze stats
      help control enemies. Cooldown: 15 seconds. Mana: 25.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103782127609147392
    m_Localized: Icy Palisade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103782127705616384
    m_Localized: 'Three groups of spikes erupt ahead about 0.15 seconds apart. Each
      group deals 250% weapon damage converted to cold, then shatters. Each maximum
      Mystic Shield charge grants 20% additional damage: capacity 3 gives 400% weapon
      damage per group. Current charges do not affect the bonus and are not consumed.
      Area of Effect enlarges the spikes. Each spike finds its own ground and skips
      gaps; no obstacles are created. Cooldown: 10 seconds. Mana: 25.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104154654441304064
    m_Localized: Double Discharge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104154654533578752
    m_Localized: Two rapid discharges, each dealing 100% weapon damage. The first
      gains 50% increased shock buildup and +50 percentage points of Shock Chance.
      The second gains +50 percentage points of Critical Strike Multiplier. Bonuses
      apply only to their respective discharge. Beams stop at terrain; Spell Speed
      accelerates the pair. No cooldown or mana cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
